sorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/a49f0be046903c941dd60e09e723ea94.poster.avif?t=1691604077\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/a49f0be046903c941dd60e09e723ea94.webm?t=1691604077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/ce3d56d3848f94572d0bac26f87528bc.avif?t=1691604077\" /></span><br>Your choices hold immense significance as you venture through a vast universe. Every decision shapes your path, leading to consequences that can be both transformative and impactful. Navigate wisely, for your choices will determine your destiny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/55e1f8516308ad762c25a5b455b197d0.poster.avif?t=1691604077\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/55e1f8516308ad762c25a5b455b197d0.webm?t=1691604077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266980/extras/b763fd01c7a7d69fce3eb0bc9404faf5.avif?t=1691604077\" /></span><br>As if one player was not bad enough, a friend can hop in and join the struggle.(persuasion skills are not included).",
